{"title": "13K views · 534 reactions | 深圳食過含金量最高燒肉界天花板😍 留言「yum」話你知點Book枱！ The highest-value yakiniku experience I’ve had in Shenzhen. Comment “yum” for booking details. 全程解放雙手食盡海膽和牛 MVP 絕對係蟹粉海膽釜飯每啖配蟹醋鮮甜到爆 🦀 海膽甜蝦撻雙重鮮味都正到不得了🤩 燒肉絕對係戲肉，方塊和牛燒到油脂迫晒出嚟，切開超粉嫩🔥 加埋 Wasabi、原粒黑胡椒，油花喺個口度爆出嚟，但完全唔膩👍🏼原條牛舌奶香味都勁出 🐄 估唔到雞油配北寄貝，呢個配搭可以咁 Juicy 💯 呢間走日式庭園氛圍高質烤肉，試過就知真係有料到！ Hands-free dining at its finest! The MVP is undoubtedly the crab roe and sea urchin kama-meshi (claypot rice); every bite paired with crab vinegar is explosively fresh and sweet. The sea urchin and sweet shrimp tart delivers a double hit of umami that’s absolutely stunning. The cubed wagyu is the showstopper—grilled until the fat renders out completely, sliced to reveal a perfect blush pink centre, and elevated with wasabi and whole black peppercorns. The fat melts in your mouth without any heaviness. The whole ox tongue has a beautiful milky richness, and the unexpected pairing of chicken oil with hokki clam is surprisingly juicy and indulgent. Set in a refined Japanese garden ambiance, this place truly delivers on every level. 𝙈𝙮 𝙋𝙞𝙘𝙠𝙨 推薦 ♡ : ⌕ 蟹粉海膽釜飯 ⌕ 海膽甜蝦撻 ⌕ 方塊和牛 ⌕ 幻切和牛牛舌 ⌕ 雞油北寄貝 📍 大無燒肉（深圳灣萬象城店） （粤海街道海德一道1218號深圳灣萬象城C區L3層CL310） 🚇 地鐵13號線後海站K1出口 #hkfoodcravers_shenzhen | hkfoodcravers", "description": "深圳食過含金量最高燒肉界天花板😍\n留言「yum」話你知點Book枱！\n\nThe highest-value yakiniku experience I’ve had in Shenzhen. Comment “yum” for booking details.\n\n全程解放雙手食盡海膽和牛 MVP 絕對係蟹粉海膽釜飯每啖配蟹醋鮮甜到爆 🦀 海膽甜蝦撻雙重鮮味都正到不得了🤩 燒肉絕對係戲肉，方塊和牛燒到油脂迫晒出嚟，切開超粉嫩🔥 加埋 Wasabi、原粒黑胡椒，油花喺個口度爆出嚟，但完全唔膩👍🏼原條牛舌奶香味都勁出 🐄 估唔到雞油配北寄貝，呢個配搭可以咁 Juicy 💯 呢間走日式庭園氛圍高質烤肉，試過就知真係有料到！\n\nHands-free dining at its finest! The MVP is undoubtedly the crab roe and sea urchin kama-meshi (claypot rice); every bite paired with crab vinegar is explosively fresh and sweet. The sea urchin and sweet shrimp tart delivers a double hit of umami that’s absolutely stunning. The cubed wagyu is the showstopper—grilled until the fat renders out completely, sliced to reveal a perfect blush pink centre, and elevated with wasabi and whole black peppercorns. The fat melts in your mouth without any heaviness. The whole ox tongue has a beautiful milky richness, and the unexpected pairing of chicken oil with hokki clam is surprisingly juicy and indulgent. Set in a refined Japanese garden ambiance, this place truly delivers on every level. \n\n𝙈𝙮 𝙋𝙞𝙘𝙠𝙨 推薦 ♡ :\n⌕ 蟹粉海膽釜飯\n⌕ 海膽甜蝦撻\n⌕ 方塊和牛\n⌕ 幻切和牛牛舌\n⌕ 雞油北寄貝\n\n📍 大無燒肉（深圳灣萬象城店）\n（粤海街道海德一道1218號深圳灣萬象城C區L3層CL310）\n🚇 地鐵13號線後海站K1出口\n\n#hkfoodcravers_shenzhen", "uploader": "hkfoodcravers", "uploader_id": "100091268166682", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-10/682664255_18134559949552130_5370314680390196628_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=50ce42&_nc_ohc=i3x1A6vmAGcQ7kNvwEgU3d7&_nc_oc=AdrcXRI8Jgi76DJ9MMRKjoJenOULzvqT_4aGNywf1KYAxup6fKgWmYqLsUSttn52wUzqQt2voq6OBok-2Ex-kyaK&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.xx&_nc_gid=OmjECbqUqXEcWLuKk0PR5g&_nc_ss=7c289&oh=00_Af6vIIP0MVaouZDpr6nJZVcZfhE7EezDbYJb7oa2Tv56ng&oe=69FB516F", "view_count": 83918, "concurrent_view_count": 0, "duration": 28.92, "id": "995629042913245", "formats": [{"format_id": "1000091679340888a", "manifest_url": "https://www.facebook.com/dash_mpd_debug.mpd?v=995629042913245&dummy=.mpd", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 60.457, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://video-sjc6-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNMH4F68FoDYtlds6ddvwKuOtiDzEE6jo3chn_QglzxQpqRVkD9p2Kw8xiN8wZM68eYqQbh_r3fQDqLyyra4-MmIrCrLPKTmB8V6NA.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=video-sjc6-1.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Q8ymW8VgP94Q7kNvwHsjKsn&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=OmjECbqUqXEcWLuKk0PR5g&_nc_ss=7c289&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af67xvX6EqKlJqrj8Nvo0-9U8PqCLanXa2Y8oDL38TmmJA&oe=69F75024", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "facebookexternalhit/1.1", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fet