navigate"}, "downloader_options": {"http_chunk_size": 262144000}, "protocol": "https", "video_ext": "mp4", "audio_ext": "none", "abr": 0, "vbr": 3355.074, "resolution": "1080x1920", "aspect_ratio": 0.56, "format": "1307175191336447v - 1080x1920 (DASH video)"}], "timestamp": 1777370411, "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "webpage_url": "https://m.facebook.com/watch/?v=995629042913245&_rdr", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "m.facebook.com", "extractor": "facebook", "extractor_key": "Facebook", "thumbnails": [{"url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-10/682664255_18134559949552130_5370314680390196628_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s960x960_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=50ce42&_nc_ohc=i3x1A6vmAGcQ7kNvwEgU3d7&_nc_oc=AdrcXRI8Jgi76DJ9MMRKjoJenOULzvqT_4aGNywf1KYAxup6fKgWmYqLsUSttn52wUzqQt2voq6OBok-2Ex-kyaK&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.xx&_nc_gid=OmjECbqUqXEcWLuKk0PR5g&_nc_ss=7c289&oh=00_Af6vIIP0MVaouZDpr6nJZVcZfhE7EezDbYJb7oa2Tv56ng&oe=69FB516F", "id": "0"}], "display_id": "995629042913245", "fulltitle": "13K views · 534 reactions | 深圳食過含金量最高燒肉界天花板😍 留言「yum」話你知點Book枱！ The highest-value yakiniku experience I’ve had in Shenzhen. Comment “yum” for booking details. 全程解放雙手食盡海膽和牛 MVP 絕對係蟹粉海膽釜飯每啖配蟹醋鮮甜到爆 🦀 海膽甜蝦撻雙重鮮味都正到不得了🤩 燒肉絕對係戲肉，方塊和牛燒到油脂迫晒出嚟，切開超粉嫩🔥 加埋 Wasabi、原粒黑胡椒，油花喺個口度爆出嚟，但完全唔膩👍🏼原條牛舌奶香味都勁出 🐄 估唔到雞油配北寄貝，呢個配搭可以咁 Juicy 💯 呢間走日式庭園氛圍高質烤肉，試過就知真係有料到！ Hands-free dining at its finest! The MVP is undoubtedly the crab roe and sea urchin kama-meshi (claypot rice); every bite paired with crab vinegar is explosively fresh and sweet. The sea urchin and sweet shrimp tart delivers a double hit of umami that’s absolutely stunning. The cubed wagyu is the showstopper—grilled until the fat renders out completely, sliced to reveal a perfect blush pink centre, and elevated with wasabi and whole black peppercorns. The fat melts in your mouth without any heaviness. The whole ox tongue has a beautiful milky richness, and the unexpected pairing of chicken oil with hokki clam is surprisingly juicy and indulgent. Set in a refined Japanese garden ambiance, this place truly delivers on every level. 𝙈𝙮 𝙋𝙞𝙘𝙠𝙨 推薦 ♡ : ⌕ 蟹粉海膽釜飯 ⌕ 海膽甜蝦撻 ⌕ 方塊和牛 ⌕ 幻切和牛牛舌 ⌕ 雞油北寄貝 📍 大無燒肉（深圳灣萬象城店） （粤海街道海德一道1218號深圳灣萬象城C區L3層CL310） 🚇 地鐵13號線後海站K1出口 #hkfoodcravers_shenzhen | hkfoodcravers", "duration_string": "28", "upload_date": "20260428", "epoch": 1777693999, "format_id": "hd", "quality": -2, "url": "https://video-sjc3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMhu92UxonDIWR99qU5x3Lhwy3OufwhW7FLNJWcZwkIK6BkBoE_L4Ttnxb7YG2bUaSPmZ8tnAQpDHvFWM2KkdPXZoK3KhafiQ-7uac.mp4?_nc_cat=103&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=video-sjc3-1.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=ztmvFdllYhIQ7kNvwHmktx5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5GQUNFQk9PSy4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTc5NTU2OTk3NzExMTM4MTQsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjozLCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MjgsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=7669b7871bdbe6ec&_nc_&_nc_gid=OmjECbqUqXEcWLuKk0PR5g&_nc_ss=7c289&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_Af4X_Se2q3iWgOwPfTTRibqMWDVu2N3AoV3OLHrwNyqPjA&oe=69F75A68&bitrate=2884267&tag=dash_baseline_1_v1", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "facebookexternalhit/1.1", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate"}, "downloader_options": {"http_chunk_size": 262144000}, "protocol": "https", "ext": "mp4", "video_ext": "mp4", "audio_ext": "none", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "format": "hd - unknown", "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.03.17", "release_git_head": "04d6974f502bbdfaed72c624344f262e30ad9708", "repository": "yt-dlp/yt-dlp"}}